[00:19.68]1. Can you see with your mind’s eye,
[00:25.42]Peoples dwelling together?
[00:34.56]Sorrow has passed. Peace at last!
[00:38.22]Life without tears or pain.
[00:41.89](Chorus)
[00:50.06]Sing out with joy of heart!
[00:53.61]You too can have a part.
[00:59.61]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[01:05.61]“Life without end, at last!”
[01:16.03]2. In those days all will be young,
[01:21.03]All at peace with Jehovah.
[01:26.88]Troubles are gone, from now on,
[01:31.88]No need to weep or fear.
[01:34.88](Chorus)
[01:37.88]Sing out with joy of heart!
[01:44.78]You too can have a part.
[01:48.78]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[01:54.78]“Life without end, at last!”
[02:29.08]3. Paradise all will enjoy
[02:32.92]As we sing of God’s glory.
[02:36.76]Long as we live, we will give
[02:42.52]Honor and praise to God.
[02:47.56](Chorus)
[02:52.60]Sing out with joy of heart!
[02:58.60]You too can have a part.
[03:03.60]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[03:09.60]“Life without end, at last!”